snes9x_3ds: single-game mode for injected CIAs

A CIA made by 3ds-forwarder carries one ROM in its RomFS plus
romfs:/manifest.cfg (content = "game.sfc", data_dir =
"sdmc:/saves/snes/<game>"). When the manifest is there the emulator:

- uses data_dir as its root directory, and keeps saves, savestates,
  configs, screenshots and cheats flat in it (game.srm, game.auto.frz,
  game.cfg, ...), next to the global settings.cfg;
- loads the ROM and resumes the auto savestate at boot;
- leaves out the "Games" tab (ROM browser) and the online updater.

Without a manifest nothing changes. Applies to matbo87/snes9x_3ds v2.0.

